OL,3,GNEWSA'My home lost half its value due
OL,4,Ato Raac'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Dundee woman whose flat lost half of
OL,7,Fits value following the discovery of
OL,8,Fpotentially dangerous concrete in the
OL,9,Fbuilding has said private homeowners
OL,10,Fmust receive financial help to repair
OL,11,Faffected properties.
OL,13,FA #21.6m repair scheme for Dundee
OL,14,Fcouncil properties affected by Raac
OL,15,F(reinforced autoclaved aerated
OL,16,Fconcrete) has been approved by
OL,17,Fcouncillors.
OL,19,FHowever, 237 privately-owned properties
OL,20,Fin the affected buildings will have to
OL,21,Fcontribute to the cost of the repair
OL,22,Fwork.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
