OL,5,
OL,6,FYvette Hoskins, who sold her flat in a
OL,7,FRaac-affected building for #55,000
OL,8,Fdespite its #100,000 value, said the
OL,9,Fexperience was "daunting and
OL,10,Fdevastating".
